1
00:00:02,083 --> 00:00:04,458
Lady Livia, did- did you misspeak?

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,000
I am perfectly clear.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:06,916
Step aside.

4
00:00:08,666 --> 00:00:10,083
I will handle this myself.

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,541
Years ago, I
got engaged to Severin.

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,500
Back then he was
ambitious and full of

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,083
promise, everything a
noble lady could want.

8
00:00:26,791 --> 00:00:27,791
But he changed.

9
00:00:32,916 --> 00:00:35,416
When Count Carter sent him
 away to gain experience,

10
00:00:36,625 --> 00:00:38,708
he just hid in the mines,

11
00:00:39,541 --> 00:00:41,625
