all understand my painful decision.

19
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,041
Livia, I stand with you!

20
00:01:37,833 --> 00:01:41,041
Livia, the gods have
finally opened your eyes.

21
00:01:42,416 --> 00:01:46,458
A woman of
your noble standing could

22
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:48,500
never be with trash like Severin.

23
00:01:55,250 --> 00:01:58,416
Severin Carter, do you
have anything left to say?
